<title>GREECE: BANK/GREECE INJECTS 78.9 BLN DRACHMAS IN 7-DAY REPOS.</title>
<headline>BANK/GREECE INJECTS 78.9 BLN DRACHMAS IN 7-DAY REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece allocated 78.9 billion drachmas in seven-day securities repurchase funds at 12.60 percent on Wednesday, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Bids were fully satisfied,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
